{"name":"four_point_intersections_with_low_overlap_bound_family","v":1,"source_hash":"93bdbb7c46368751","lines":["⊢ ∀ {I : Type u_1} {V : Type u_2} [inst : DecidableEq I] [inst_1 : DecidableEq V] (F : Finset I) (Q : I → Finset V),","    (∀ i ∈ F, (Q i).card ≤ 6) →","      (∀ i ∈ F, ∀ j ∈ F, i ≠ j → (Q i ∩ Q j).card = 4) →","        (∀ i ∈ F, ∀ j ∈ F, i ≠ j → ∀ q ∈ Q i ∩ Q j, {l ∈ (F.erase i).erase j | q ∈ Q l}.card ≤ 1) → F.card ≤ 4","I : Type u_1","V : Type u_2","instI : DecidableEq I","instV : DecidableEq V","F : Finset I","Q : I → Finset V","hsize : ∀ i ∈ F, (Q i).card ≤ 6","hpair : ∀ i ∈ F, ∀ j ∈ F, i ≠ j → (Q i ∩ Q j).card = 4","hload : ∀ i ∈ F, ∀ j ∈ F, i ≠ j → ∀ q ∈ Q i ∩ Q j, {l ∈ (F.erase i).erase j | q ∈ Q l}.card ≤ 1","⊢ F.card ≤ 4","case pos","hsmall : F.card ≤ 1","case neg","hsmall : ¬F.card ≤ 1","i : I","hi : i ∈ F","j : I","hj : j ∈ F","hij : i ≠ j","⊢ 1 < F.card","R : Finset V := Q i ∩ Q j","T : Finset I := (F.erase i).erase j","hR : R.card = 4","hj' : j ∈ F.erase i","hT : T.card + 2 = F.card","⊢ T.card + 2 = F.card","⊢ ((F.erase i).erase j).card + 2 = F.card","⊢ F.card - 1 - 1 + 2 = F.card","hother : ∀ l ∈ T, l ∈ F ∧ l ≠ i ∧ l ≠ j","⊢ ∀ l ∈ T, l ∈ F ∧ l ≠ i ∧ l ≠ j","l : I","hl : l ∈ T","⊢ l ∈ F ∧ l ≠ i ∧ l ≠ j","hl : l ≠ j ∧ l ≠ i ∧ l ∈ F","htwo : ∀ l ∈ T, 2 ≤ (R ∩ Q l).card","⊢ ∀ l ∈ T, 2 ≤ (R ∩ Q l).card","⊢ 2 ≤ (R ∩ Q l).card","hlF : l ∈ F","hli : l ≠ i","hlj : l ≠ j","hil : i ≠ l","hcard : (Q i ∩ Q j ∩ (Q i ∩ Q l)).card + (Q i ∩ Q j ∪ Q i ∩ Q l).card = (Q i ∩ Q j).card + (Q i ∩ Q l).card","hunion : (Q i ∩ Q j ∪ Q i ∩ Q l).card ≤ (Q i).card","⊢ (Q i ∩ Q j ∪ Q i ∩ Q l).card ≤ (Q i).card","R : Finset V := ⋯","T : Finset I := ⋯","⊢ Q i ∩ Q j ∪ Q i ∩ Q l ⊆ Q i","x : V","hx : x ∈ Q i ∩ Q j ∪ Q i ∩ Q l","⊢ x ∈ Q i","case inl","hx✝ : x ∈ Q i ∩ Q j ∪ Q i ∩ Q l","hx : x ∈ Q i ∩ Q j","case inr","hx : x ∈ Q i ∩ Q l","heq : Q i ∩ Q j ∩ (Q i ∩ Q l) = R ∩ Q l","⊢ Q i ∩ Q j ∩ (Q i ∩ Q l) = R ∩ Q l","⊢ x ∈ Q i ∩ Q j ∩ (Q i ∩ Q l) ↔ x ∈ R ∩ Q l","⊢ x ∈ Q i → x ∈